== Mk-tier ladder mapping ==
The Psi Harmonizer preset is the
'''second''' Psi-Tech preset to ship. Per the 7-step Mk-ladder
canonical taxonomy:

* '''[[HelmKit Mk2.0]]''' — Harmonizer firmware addition once its
  input pipeline (EEG state inference + HRV-coherence) exists.
* '''[[HelmKit Mk3.0]]''' — Harmonizer goes '''live in its dyadic
  form''' here. Two synchronized helmets driven from a common
  synastry compute node, optionally driven by [[SynastryEngine]]
  astrological timing. This is the apparatus the wiki Harmonizer
  page actually promises.

The Harmonizer's defining capability — bilateral cross-wearer
state-input — requires the Mk3.0 dyadic substrate to be
testable.

